# Client secrets of the sign-in providers (Google, Microsoft, Zoho) go in this
# directory, one file each: google-client-secret, microsoft-client-secret,
# zoho-client-secret. compose.yaml mounts it read-only into the server at
# /run/secrets/campbooks; see "Built-in sign-in" in deploy/README.md.
# Never commit them.
*
!.gitignore
